  "-1539599950": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "I saw the news. How are you holding up, brother?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "447923078": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Trying to keep it together, Samuel. It’s been… rough. Not just for me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "309331787": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "I can imagine. Losing a position like that... especially the way it happened, would shake anyone.\nBut you're not alone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2144113383": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -401233384,
    1980657666,
    -1604634051
   ],
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "Your {F}'s strong. But even the strongest need help sometimes.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-401233384": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2144113383,
   "children": [
    -1454469563
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Thanks, Samuel. That means a lot.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1980657666": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2144113383,
   "children": [
    -776595107
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Are you offering something specific?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-776595107": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1980657666,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "I mean it in every sense. Practical or spiritual. If things get tight, come see me. We'll find a way. Pride won’t put food on the table.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1454469563": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -401233384,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "Of course. My door is always open, whether you need guidance, someone to talk to, or just a quiet place to breathe.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1604634051": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2144113383,
   "children": [
    -987643285
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "We don’t need charity.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-987643285": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1604634051,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "This isn’t charity, son. This is what community looks like. I’m not here to save you, I’m here to remind you that you don’t have to fight alone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-981294695": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "Whatever happens next, don’t shut people out. And don’t wait until it’s too late to ask for help.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2122242064": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "Pride's a heavy chain. You don’t need to carry it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1340952999": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Thank you, Samuel.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1829916312": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "V_Samuel",
   "expressionName": "my-expression",
   "text": "Be safe, all of you. And if you need me, you know where I’ll be.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
